# The AI set. Installed only when someone picks an AI at first start or in
# Settings; a machine set to No AI has none of it on disk (Alex,
# 2026-09-30). No other set may depend on it or on anything in it
# (tests/pkgs/run.sh, "no AI outside the AI sets"). The Moneta panel, the
# Desk's AI parts and the team harness join here as they are built;
# invictus-voice (whisper) is the other AI set.

